"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4599050","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4486230-1829528821305905","game_id":"steam-4486230","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #2","summary":"Hello everyone!To enable the idle feature in the demo, I've been doing some testing over the past two weeks. While running it overnight, I discovered some memory leaks. They weren't that serious, but as someone with \"OCD\", it was frustrating not to fix them.Then, to ensure a smooth gaming experience later on, I made some balance adjustments (yes, the numbers were all filled in with my feet XD).Also, the Digipedia is basically complete.The rest is mostly miscellaneous stuff, nothing much to say. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-09T07:53:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821305905","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4486230-1827626365756781","game_id":"steam-4486230","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog #1: Treasure synergy","summary":"Hello everyone,I've been working on Treasure Synergy over the past week.What’s new?Treasure Sets: These are activated by equipping every piece of a set.Slots: These are activated by placing a treasure into the center of a specific item, like putting a CD into a CD player.But what if you put the wrong thing in the slot? You'll get a funny face staring back at you! LOL.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-20T08:23:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365756781","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4486230":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:31:41Z